OL,3,GNEWSAThree people in court over town
OL,4,Acentre shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men and a 17-year-old boy have
OL,7,Fappeared in court charged with
OL,8,Fattempted murder after a shotgun was
OL,9,Ffired in what police described as a
OL,10,F"targeted attack".
OL,12,FEssex Police said officers were called
OL,13,Fat 22:10 BST on 31 August to Market
OL,14,FPlace in Braintree, where three people
OL,15,Fwere hurt, two of them sustaining
OL,16,Fserious injuries to their faces.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
