OL,3,GNEWSAThree people in court over town
OL,4,Acentre shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDestiny Ema, 23, of Meadgate Avenue,
OL,7,FChelmsford; Kayden Brown, 18, of Noakes
OL,8,FAvenue, Chelmsford, and a 17-year-old
OL,9,Ffrom Braintree ` who cannot be named
OL,10,Fbecause of his age ` appeared at
OL,11,FChelmsford Magistrates' Court.
OL,13,FAll three defendants were remanded in
OL,14,Fcustody and their cases sent to
OL,15,FChelmsford Crown Court for a plea and
OL,16,Ftrial preparation hearing on 5 October.
